{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/pulls/68","id":3581430928,"node_id":"PR_kwDOOns7hc7VeEyQ","html_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/68","diff_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/68.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/68.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/68","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/pulls/68/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/pulls/68/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/68/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/statuses/d80982d4324d369e6764087c75e7359a2d0ce647","number":68,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix: use Count(\"pk\") to support models with custom primary key (closes #65)","user":{"login":"gghez","id":6266247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNjYyNDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6266247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez","html_url":"https://github.com/gghez","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- Replace `Count(\"id\")` with `Count(\"pk\")` in the `$group` stage handler of `apply_json_mango_query` (both `$sum: 1` and `$count: 1` branches).\n- Django's `pk` alias resolves to the actual primary key field regardless of its name, so this works uniformly whether the model uses the default `id` field or a custom primary key (e.g. `UUIDField(primary_key=True)`).\n\nCloses #65.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Define a model with a custom primary key (e.g. `uuid = models.UUIDField(primary_key=True)`).\n- [ ] Run a pipeline containing `{\"$group\": {\"_id\": null, \"total\": {\"$count\": 1}}}` and confirm it returns a result instead of raising `FieldError: Cannot resolve keyword 'id' into field`.\n- [ ] Run the same pipeline with `{\"$sum\": 1}` and confirm the same.\n- [ ] Confirm existing models with a default `id` primary key still behave identically.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-04-24T21:10:21Z","updated_at":"2026-04-24T21:14:19Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"f1cf836f22c0f24cdb5ebd7c0abedabec158fd06","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"gghez:fix/65-custom-pk-count","ref":"fix/65-custom-pk-count","repo":{"id":1220375880,"node_id":"R_kgDOSL11SA","name":"django-mcp-server","full_name":"gghez/django-mcp-server","owner":{"login":"gghez","id":6266247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNjYyNDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6266247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez","html_url":"https://github.com/gghez","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gghez/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggh